<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="vi">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>{{eventName}} - Gallery</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --navy-bg: #020617;
            --gold: #c5a059;
            --glass: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
            --glass-border: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
        }

        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }

        body {
            background-color: var(--navy-bg);
            /* Gradient glow in background */
            background-image: radial-gradient(circle at 10% 20%, rgba(197, 160, 89, 0.05) 0%, transparent 40%),
                              radial-gradient(circle at 90% 80%, rgba(30, 58, 138, 0.2) 0%, transparent 40%);
            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
            color: #f8fafc;
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            padding: 40px 20px;
        }

        .glass-wrapper {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 850px;
        }

        /* Frosted Header */
        .glass-header {
            background: var(--glass);
            backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
            -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
            border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
            border-radius: 24px;
            padding: 40px;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .glass-header h1 {
            font-size: 22px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            background: linear-gradient(to right, #fff, var(--gold));
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
        }

        .guest-chip {
            background: rgba(197, 160, 89, 0.15);
            border: 1px solid var(--gold);
            padding: 8px 20px;
            border-radius: 50px;
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: var(--gold);
        }

        /* Media Area */
        .glass-body {
            background: var(--glass);
            backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
            -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
            border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
            border-radius: 24px;
            padding: 24px;
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1.5fr 1fr;
            gap: 24px;
        }

        .video-side {
            background: #000;
            border-radius: 16px;
            overflow: hidden;
            line-height: 0;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
        }

        .video-side video, .video-side img {
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            object-fit: contain;
        }

        .info-side {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: center;
        }

        .info-side h2 {
            font-size: 28px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            font-weight: 300;
        }

        .info-side p {
            color: #94a3b8;
            font-size: 15px;
            line-height: 1.6;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        .btn-group {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 12px;
        }

        .btn {
            padding: 16px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            text-decoration: none;
            text-align: center;
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 13px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            transition: 0.3s;
        }

        .btn-gold {
            background: var(--gold);
            color: var(--navy-bg);
        }

        .btn-gold:hover {
            box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(197, 160, 89, 0.4);
            transform: translateY(-2px);
        }

        .btn-outline {
            border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
            color: #fff;
        }

        .btn-outline:hover {
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
        }

        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .glass-header { flex-direction: column; gap: 20px; text-align: center; }
            .glass-body { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
            .info-side { text-align: center; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="glass-wrapper">
        <header class="glass-header">
            <h1>{{eventName}}</h1>
            <div class="guest-chip">VIP GUEST</div>
        </header>

        <main class="glass-body">
            <div class="video-side">
                {{#if isVideo}}
                    <video controls preload="auto" poster="{{thumbnailUrl}}">
                        <source src="{{mediaUrl}}" type="video/mp4">
                    </video>
                {{else}}
                    <img src="{{mediaUrl}}" alt="Media">
                {{/if}}
            </div>

            <div class="info-side">
                <h2>Xin chào, <br><b>{{guestName}}</b></h2>
                <p>Cảm ơn Quý khách đã đồng hành cùng chúng tôi. Trân trọng gửi đến Quý khách những khoảnh khắc được lưu lại.</p>
                
                <div class="btn-group">
                    <a href="{{mediaUrl}}" download class="btn btn-gold">Tải xuống chất lượng cao</a>
                    {{#if driveViewUrl}}
                    <a href="{{driveViewUrl}}" target="_blank" class="btn btn-outline">Xem bộ sưu tập đầy đủ</a>
                    {{/if}}
                </div>
            </div>
        </main>

        <footer style="text-align: center; margin-top: 30px; font-size: 11px; color: #475569;">
            {{year}} © DIGITAL MEDIA HUB | {{eventName}}
        </footer>
    </div>

</body>
</html>
